src/predge_ready/data/minimums.json contains version floors taken from the
minimum-versions.json file shipped in the "clustermax" 0.3.0 package
(SemiAnalysis, Apache License 2.0). No other clustermax code is included;
predge-ready calls the separately installed cmax CLI when present.

src/predge_ready/data/criteria.json lists the publicly published ClusterMAX
criteria (https://www.clustermax.ai/criteria) under Predge's own row IDs.
